Run a local model with Ollama, then add to config:
ollama run llama3.2
Add to config (partial — merge into ~/.nanobot/config.json):
{
  "providers": {
    "ollama": {
      "apiBase": "http://localhost:11434"
    }
  },
  "agents": {
    "defaults": {
      "provider": "ollama",
      "model": "llama3.2"
    }
  }
}


